  "notes": [
    "Each service has its own copy of src/util/broker.ts: KafkaPublish(kafka, topic, payload) calls producer.send({topic: topic}) on kafka.producer(), and KafkaSubscribe subscribes kafka.consumer() to the file's constant KAFKA_TOPIC ('<service>-topic'). The Kafka client is made by CreateKafkaClient (new Kafka(...)) and passed in as a parameter.",
    "client is the producer.send({ line in the publishing service's broker.ts, which every topic that service publishes shares; producer_invocation is the KafkaPublish(kafka, '<topic>', ...) call in src/api that fixes the topic. server is the consumer.subscribe line in the consuming service's broker.ts.",
    "api-gateway proxies /user, /client and /product to the services with express-http-proxy (URLs from .env.dev): prefix routes, not labelled here."
  ]
